#: includes/Admin/PrivacyPolicy.php:58
msgid "Events and calendars"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/PrivacyPolicy.php:60
msgid "Event and venue information on this site is published by us, not collected from you. Viewing an event page, browsing the calendar or subscribing to the calendar feed does not create a record about you, and Blockendar sets no cookies."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/PrivacyPolicy.php:65
msgid "Where an event page shows a map, the map images are loaded directly from OpenStreetMap. Your browser contacts openstreetmap.org to fetch them, which means your IP address is visible to that service. This happens only on pages that display a map."
msgstr ""

